  Text: "Mike is a strange, sunburnt road tripper with a nervous twinkle in his eyes.
    \n \nHe appears to be in a perpetual ready to walk away if you approach him state.
    \n  \nAnd he's always checking if he is next to <link>a tricycle with the name
    Mora written on it</link>. "
